sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client (React 18 SPA)
    participant Router as API Router (Express 5)
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant Controller as Controller & Service
    participant DB as Database (MongoDB / Mongoose)

    Client->>Router: HTTP Request (Cookie / Bearer JWT + JSON)
    Router->>Auth: Invoke authenticate(req)
    Auth->>DB: User.findById(decoded.userId)
    DB-->>Auth: Return account status & sessionVersion

    alt Invalid, expired, or invalidated JWT
        Auth-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized (AUTH_REQUIRED / SESSION_INVALIDATED)
    else Authenticated active session
        Auth-->>Router: Attach req.user & pass checkMaintenance()
        Router->>Controller: Enforce authorize(roles) & validate(ZodSchema)
        alt Insufficient role or schema failure
            Controller-->>Client: 403 Forbidden / 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
        else Authorized and validated
            Controller->>DB: Execute Mongoose query or atomic update
            DB-->>Controller: Return persisted document(s)
            Controller-->>Client: 200 OK / 201 Created (JSON Response)
        end
    end
